    <forceEntry id="2aea-fc0d-87ed-8846" name="Solar Auxilia (Allied Contingent)" hidden="false">
      <rules>
        <rule id="fdcd-2158-b76a-93d4" name="Army List" hidden="false">
          <description>Strategy Rating 3. Formation initiative 2+.
2 Support Detachments may be taken per Line Detachment.
Each detachment may purchase up to three upgrades, each only once.
Up to 1/3 of the army's points may be spent on Allies or Lords of War.
Cohesive allies: Legio Titanicus, Legion Astartes, Knight Household.
Disruptive allies: Mechanicum Taghmata, Daemons Of The Ruinstorm.
Allied Contingent: formations here count towards the primary army's Allies &amp; Lords of War allowance. Supreme Commanders must come from the primary army.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
